qore-uuid-module (1.4.2+git20260928.1-0qore1~ubuntu26.04) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add native Debian/Ubuntu packaging for the UUID module, compiler metadata,
    HTML documentation and examples, with automatic debug symbols.
  * Build and test against the packaged Qore SDK; record the libqore ABI
    dependency explicitly because native modules resolve Qore symbols at load.
  * Run the upstream suite during builds and against installed packages.

